WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.600
The command palette: every action in Mash, with the keys that run it.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.500
The workspace picker: one workspace per project, each with its own tabs and agents.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.600
The file finder, previewing a file's source without leaving the keyboard.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.900
The review tab: uncommitted changes, the working diff, local branches, and recent commits.
